<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
  <meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer">
  <title>{% block title %}Une pause imprévue · WikiFormation{% endblock %}</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="{{ asset('uploads/photos/entite/favicon/favicon-wikiformation.png') }}">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('dist/css/two-factor.css') }}">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('dist/css/auth-pages.css') }}?v=2">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('dist/css/error-pages.css') }}?v=1">
</head>
<body class="auth-account-page error-page">
<main class="auth-shell auth-account">
  <section class="auth-intro" aria-label="WikiFormation">
    <a class="auth-brand" href="{{ path('app_public') }}"><img src="{{ asset('uploads/photos/entite/logo/logo-wikiformation.png') }}" alt="WikiFormation"></a>
    <div class="intro-copy">
      <span class="eyebrow">TOUJOURS À VOS CÔTÉS</span>
      <h1>Une pause imprévue.<br><span>Votre parcours continue.</span></h1>
      <p>Un détour ne change pas votre destination. Retrouvez votre espace ou laissez-nous vous aider.</p>
      <div class="error-orbit" aria-hidden="true"><span>{% block code %}↗{% endblock %}</span></div>
    </div>
    <p class="auth-footnote">WikiFormation · La formation, simplement.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="auth-form-panel" aria-labelledby="auth-title">
    <div class="shield" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M12 3 21 7v6c0 5-9 9-9 9s-9-4-9-9V7Z"/><path d="M12 8v6m0 2v2"/></svg></div>
    {% block panel %}{% endblock %}
  </section>
</main>
</body>
</html>
